{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your father is a scientist who recently asked you to meet him in his laboratory, telling you that his life's work has finally paid off. He found something so incredible that you had to be there to witness it first hand. It is time to find out what your father has been working on all his life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally an entry for the ATOM GameJam #2, EXISTANTIAL is a first-person story-driven puzzle game where you are required to cheat in order to progress. Think outside of the box and pay close attention to hints scattered around the environments to break the illusion of existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Solve unique puzzles that will require you to alter reality </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Explore a science lab environment filled with clues that will help you uncover the truth behind your existence </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Discover a story that will eliminate the fourth wall and put your existence inside the game world </strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1859790?t=1765345345","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765345345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859790/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765345345","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859790/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765345345","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your father is a scientist who recently asked you to meet him in his laboratory, telling you that his life's work has finally paid off. He found something so incredible that you had to be there to witness it first hand. It is time to find out what your father has been working on all his life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally an entry for the ATOM GameJam #2, EXISTANTIAL is a first-person story-driven puzzle game where you are required to cheat in order to progress. Think outside of the box and pay close attention to hints scattered around the environments to break the illusion of existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Solve unique puzzles that will require you to alter reality </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Explore a science lab environment filled with clues that will help you uncover the truth behind your existence </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Discover a story that will eliminate the fourth wall and put your existence inside the game world </strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Ahmet Zahit D\u00f6nmez"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859790/header.jpg?t=1765345345","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1859790/428780/847ae8dc50a1337f63e54d34eac6ebfddbda038e/1751039492/dash_av1.mpd?t=1641903642","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1859790/428780/847ae8dc50a1337f63e54d34eac6ebfddbda038e/1751039492/dash_h264.mpd?t=1641903642","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1859790/428780/847ae8dc50a1337f63e54d34eac6ebfddbda038e/1751039492/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1641903642","id":256867453,"name":"EXISTENTIAL - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.aka